description: |
  Fetches detailed information about a specific issue from Jira by its issue details. This command retrieves fields such as summary, description, status, assignee, reporter, and other relevant metadata to help track and manage Jira issues efficiently.
display: Jira - Get Issue
isdetailsoverridden: false
